    <DocumentationNarrative Id="source:cli:meta-weave:app:narrative:guide" DocumentationSubjectId="source:cli:meta-weave:app" PreviousNarrativeId="source:cli:meta-weave:app:narrative:summary">
      <Body>Create one weave workspace with `create`, then use `add-direction` for either or both independent orientations between its model contracts. Pipe each WeaveScript query to `add-transformation` through standard input; the workspace stores the semantic query graph and no script path. Use `show` to inspect the complete weave and `emit-transformation` to render one query as recognizable T-SQL. `apply` selects a direction, reads explicit source and target contract workspaces, instantiates the target through Meta Core operations in target-DAG order, and writes a new XML, C#, or SQL workspace. Every insertion is validated by the target model's normal operations; there is no separate final-validation pass.</Body>
